src/content/docs/extending-nx/tooling-plugin.mdoc:Inferred tasks work well for getting users started using your tool quickly, but you can also provide users with [executors](/docs/extending-nx/guides/local-executors), which are another way of encapsulating a task script for easy use in an Nx workspace. Without inferred tasks, executors must be explicitly configured for each task.
